  "description": "-This course introduces students to a professional studio experience where their goal is to create a 3D animated short film from scratch using Autodesk Maya. -Students will be responsible for all aspects of production, from developing their own original story, creating storyboards and concept art to finalizing textures, animation, character models, and lighting in a complete short film.",
